# The source the per-flavour tocs are generated from -- one today,
# Manners_Camelot.toc -- and the fallback the game reads on any client that does
# not honour a suffixed name. Edit this one; run `python tools/maketocs.py` and
# the generated toc follows. tests/validate.py fails if they have drifted.
#
# The interface is a single number, 16001, because 1.0 ships for WoW Forever
# alone. It is the one client anybody here can test, and the number is the one
# that shipped and is known to work there.
## Interface: 16001, 11509, 20506, 50504, 120105
## Title: Manners
## Notes: Somebody buffed you. One click buffs them back, and your target is handed straight back.
## Notes-deDE: Jemand hat Euch gestärkt. Ein Klick erwidert den Gefallen, und Euer Ziel bekommt Ihr gleich zurück.
## Notes-esES: Alguien te ha dado un beneficio. Un clic se lo devuelve, y tu objetivo anterior vuelve enseguida.
## Notes-esMX: Alguien te ha dado un beneficio. Un clic se lo devuelve, y tu objetivo anterior vuelve enseguida.
## Notes-frFR: Quelqu'un vient de vous buffer. Un clic pour lui rendre la politesse, et votre cible vous est aussitôt rendue.
## Notes-itIT: Qualcuno ti ha appena dato un beneficio. Un clic per ricambiare, e il tuo bersaglio ti viene subito restituito.
## Notes-koKR: 누군가 나에게 버프를 주면 클릭 한 번으로 보답하고, 내 대상도 곧바로 돌려받습니다.
## Notes-ptBR: Alguém acabou de dar um bônus a você. Um clique devolve o favor, e o seu alvo anterior volta na hora.
## Notes-zhCN: 有人给你加了增益，一键回敬对方，你原来的目标也会马上恢复。
## Notes-zhTW: 有人替你加了增益，一鍵回敬對方，你原本的目標也會馬上恢復。
